WEBVTT

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.606
I wish I hadn't worked so hard.

00:03:05.798 --> 00:03:06.856
Number two:

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.267
I wish I had stayed
in touch with my friends.

00:03:11.346 --> 00:03:12.477
Number three:

00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:14.968
I wish I had let myself be happier.

00:03:17.722 --> 00:03:18.909
Number four:

00:03:18.933 --> 00:03:22.120
I wish I'd had the courage
to express my true self.

00:03:23.824 --> 00:03:25.269
And number five:

00:03:25.293 --> 00:03:27.977
I wish I'd lived a life true to my dreams,

00:03:28.001 --> 00:03:30.006
instead of what others expected of me.